1
00:00:02,555 --> 00:00:05,774
(Episode 2)

2
00:00:08,244 --> 00:00:12,779
Eun Seo's father is
the president of the Parents Association.

3
00:00:12,779 --> 00:00:14,779
Her brother is
the president of the Students' Union.

4
00:00:14,779 --> 00:00:18,270
And Eun Seo is the class vice president.

5
00:00:19,107 --> 00:00:21,270
The class president?

6
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,654
Hello.

7
00:00:24,459 --> 00:00:26,140
Ms. Im Kyung Ha.

8
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:28,770
Sin Ae is the top student
in the whole school,

9
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:30,735
and the class vice president.

10
00:00:30,735 --> 00:00:31,831
What?

11
00:00:31,831 --> 00:00:33,824
Are you the vice president?

12
00:00:33,824 --> 00:00:34,824
Mom.

13
00:00:37,856 --> 00:00:40,540
Hello, I am Choi Sin Ae.

14
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,668
Sin Ae.

15
00:00:46,707 --> 00:00:47,856
Hi.

16
00:00:51,508 --> 00:00:52,559
You are pretty.

17
00:00:54,099 --> 00:00:56,460
I don't want to take up your time
knowing that you are busy,

18
00:00:56,460 --> 00:01:01,677
but since the parents
of class representatives are here,

19
00:01:01,677 --> 00:01:06,110
I would love to discuss
school matters with you.

20
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:08,415
School matters?
I don't know anything about that.

21
00:01:08,415 --> 00:01:11,625
I told you not to take any positions
such as a class vice president.

22
00:01:15,336 --> 00:01:16,709
No, please don't worry.

23
00:01:18,252 --> 00:01:21,139
I did not intend to cause any burden.

24
00:01:21,139 --> 00:01:23,493
Ms. Kim Soon Im.

25
00:01:25,449 --> 00:01:28,298
You must be very proud of her.

26
00:01:29,238 --> 00:01:32,954
Her classmates voted for her.

27
00:01:38,614 --> 00:01:40,610
So, you should let her take on her role.

28
00:01:43,478 --> 00:01:44,478
Dad.

29
00:01:46,077 --> 00:01:47,077
Jun Seo.

30
00:01:48,717 --> 00:01:51,488
Excuse me. I need to go to the restroom.

31
00:02:27,383 --> 00:02:31,999
All the students have worked
so hard on this exhibition.

32
00:02:33,157 --> 00:02:35,013
Luckily all the classmates...

33
00:02:35,013 --> 00:02:39,196
get along well,
following Eun Seo and Sin Ae's lead...

34
00:02:39,196 --> 00:02:41,151
There's a call for you, teacher.

35
00:02:41,151 --> 00:02:42,178
Okay.

36
00:02:43,176 --> 00:02:46,179
Excuse me for a minute.

37
00:02:52,538 --> 00:02:58,170
You must be delighted
that Sin Ae is good at school.

38
00:03:01,521 --> 00:03:03,019
I am sure you are as well.

39
00:03:05,336 --> 00:03:09,586
Sin Ae, do you have siblings?

40
00:03:10,071 --> 00:03:13,434
She has an older brother.

41
00:03:14,033 --> 00:03:16,712
Does she? Just like us.

42
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:20,840
What grade is he in?

43
00:03:21,581 --> 00:03:23,053
He is supposed to be in high school.

44
00:03:23,053 --> 00:03:26,592
He is preparing for the GED now.

45
00:03:27,774 --> 00:03:30,036
- He was expelled.
- Hey, you!

46
00:03:37,561 --> 00:03:38,561
I see.

47
00:03:41,201 --> 00:03:43,765
Do you get along with your brother?

48
00:03:44,185 --> 00:03:45,185
No.

49
00:03:49,882 --> 00:03:50,934
Ms. Soon Im.

50
00:03:51,674 --> 00:03:56,100
Has Sin Ae ever gotten sick
when she was little?

51
00:03:56,657 --> 00:03:58,428
Look.

52
00:03:58,428 --> 00:04:01,346
Although I don't have much to offer,
I take good care of my children.

53
00:04:01,346 --> 00:04:02,978
It is none of your business.

54
00:04:02,978 --> 00:04:04,022
My goodness.

55
00:04:07,637 --> 00:04:08,668
Mom.

56
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,077
What is she like?

57
00:04:40,619 --> 00:04:41,619
Who?

58
00:04:42,626 --> 00:04:44,286
The girl who is the class president.

59
00:04:45,658 --> 00:04:47,103
Yoon Eun Seo?

60
00:04:47,103 --> 00:04:48,536
She is like a princess.

61
00:04:48,536 --> 00:04:50,286
I heard her grandfather founded
this school.

62
00:04:50,286 --> 00:04:52,729
Her family is very wealthy.
That annoys me.

63
00:04:55,786 --> 00:05:00,788
Sin Ae's mother came to check out
the blood type of her daughter.

64
00:05:02,475 --> 00:05:05,068
She has Type O blood.

65
00:05:13,235 --> 00:05:15,459
Mom and Dad seem to be tired.

66
00:05:15,459 --> 00:05:16,590
They don't want to come out.

67
00:05:18,100 --> 00:05:19,965
Honey, are you tired?

68
00:05:20,891 --> 00:05:24,875
Of course, I am. I went to the exhibition.

69
00:05:24,875 --> 00:05:28,971
I think Eun Seo is making
something delicious,

70
00:05:28,971 --> 00:05:30,431
and she would be disappointed.

71
00:05:31,003 --> 00:05:35,097
She won't.
Eun Seo is a lovely, considerate girl.

72
00:05:35,097 --> 00:05:36,638
So she would understand.

73
00:05:39,736 --> 00:05:41,798
- Happy birthday.
- Thank you.

74
00:05:41,798 --> 00:05:43,535
Open it. It's for you.

75
00:05:46,885 --> 00:05:49,566
They are us, our family.

76
00:05:49,566 --> 00:05:51,308
They are.

77
00:05:51,308 --> 00:05:53,678
Eun Seo and I made them together.

78
00:05:53,678 --> 00:05:57,680
No, Jun Seo made them and drew them.

79
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,190
He baked them in a kiln.

80
00:05:59,190 --> 00:06:00,414
What did you do, then?

81
00:06:00,414 --> 00:06:03,046
I was rooting for him.

82
00:06:03,046 --> 00:06:06,965
We will be fine sending them away
as long as we have these mugs.

83
00:06:06,965 --> 00:06:09,070
Why do we have to send them away?

84
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:11,669
I will live with them forever.

85
00:06:11,669 --> 00:06:15,485
Of course, you will.

86
00:06:15,485 --> 00:06:16,689
That is yours.

87
00:06:18,582 --> 00:06:20,517
Why do we have to send them away?

88
00:06:20,517 --> 00:06:22,067
I will live with them forever.

89
00:06:23,266 --> 00:06:25,915
Of course, you will.

90
00:06:26,521 --> 00:06:28,041
You're good at mimicking your mom.

91
00:06:28,041 --> 00:06:30,601
I just sound like her
because I am her daughter.

92
00:06:30,601 --> 00:06:31,971
Like mother, like daughter.

93
00:06:44,694 --> 00:06:45,694
Jun Seo.

94
00:06:51,387 --> 00:06:53,423
You always give me
the leftovers after selling food.

95
00:06:57,540 --> 00:06:59,236
Do you want me to go on an empty stomach?

96
00:06:59,236 --> 00:07:00,710
You said you don't want it.

97
00:07:01,803 --> 00:07:04,294
Mom, what's wrong with you these days?
Why are you so grumpy?

98
00:07:06,827 --> 00:07:08,007
Come home early.

99
00:07:09,219 --> 00:07:11,699
If I come home early,
you will have me work for you.

100
00:07:11,699 --> 00:07:14,308
That is why my brother ran away.

101
00:07:14,308 --> 00:07:15,828
What? What did you say?

102
00:07:17,554 --> 00:07:18,567
Sin Ae!

103
00:07:19,532 --> 00:07:21,691
Come home early!

104
00:07:21,691 --> 00:07:24,382
It is a market day.
There will be a lot of customers.

105
00:07:28,886 --> 00:07:30,225
Eun Seo, here's your lunchbox.

106
00:07:30,225 --> 00:07:31,579
What is today's menu?

107
00:07:33,856 --> 00:07:35,810
It is pork cutlet, isn't it?

108
00:07:36,281 --> 00:07:37,589
Thanks, Mom.

109
00:07:42,252 --> 00:07:43,366
I am ready.

110
00:07:43,915 --> 00:07:46,150
Eun Seo, wait. Your hair...

111
00:07:52,778 --> 00:07:53,972
Are they thin?

112
00:07:53,972 --> 00:07:57,680
They were thick before.
When did they become thinner?

113
00:07:59,022 --> 00:08:01,005
I am probably not your daughter.

114
00:08:01,005 --> 00:08:02,804
I don't even look like you.

115
00:08:04,257 --> 00:08:06,009
You might have adopted me.

116
00:08:06,009 --> 00:08:07,140
What?

117
00:08:10,562 --> 00:08:13,162
I'll go without you if you don't hurry.

118
00:08:14,457 --> 00:08:16,370
Eun Seo, you are good to go.

119
00:08:16,370 --> 00:08:18,027
Mom, have a good day.

120
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,532
Wait for me.

121
00:08:28,264 --> 00:08:30,444
Jun Seo, give me a ride on your bike.

122
00:08:31,026 --> 00:08:32,537
What?

123
00:08:32,537 --> 00:08:34,419
No, you're heavy.

124
00:08:34,419 --> 00:08:36,948
Are you that lazy to not even
ride your bike?

125
00:08:36,948 --> 00:08:38,178
Fine.

126
00:08:39,477 --> 00:08:43,132
Why am I so tired?

127
00:08:43,132 --> 00:08:44,713
I feel dizzy, too.

128
00:08:46,924 --> 00:08:48,832
I feel like I might have another accident.

129
00:08:50,581 --> 00:08:54,440
It is probably risky
since I'm not good at riding a bike.

130
00:09:00,604 --> 00:09:01,957
Get on.

131
00:09:01,957 --> 00:09:02,960
Thanks.

132
00:09:03,479 --> 00:09:05,895
But only this time.

133
00:09:05,895 --> 00:09:09,590
Also, don't say such a thing ever again.

134
00:09:09,590 --> 00:09:10,649
Sorry.

135
00:09:20,830 --> 00:09:23,088
It's lunchtime!

136
00:09:23,774 --> 00:09:25,925
Eun Seo has
a scrumptious-looking lunchbox.

137
00:09:25,925 --> 00:09:27,341
Come here, everyone.

138
00:09:27,341 --> 00:09:29,863
- Come here.
- Open it.

139
00:09:29,863 --> 00:09:32,809
It's like a flower garden!

140
00:09:32,809 --> 00:09:36,731
Pork cutlets, grilled sausages,
and even rolled omelets.

141
00:09:36,731 --> 00:09:38,360
Let's dig in. I will try them all.

142
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,618
It looks so delicious.

143
00:09:40,687 --> 00:09:42,002
Let me try them, too.

144
00:09:43,291 --> 00:09:45,580
- I'll get some water.
- Don't take too long.

145
00:09:58,146 --> 00:09:59,807
I'm sorry, Sin Ae.

146
00:10:04,419 --> 00:10:05,494
Sin Ae.

147
00:10:23,307 --> 00:10:24,559
Choi Sin Ae.

148
00:10:28,419 --> 00:10:30,547
You don't want...

149
00:10:30,547 --> 00:10:33,307
your classmates to see us
while we're talking here.

150
00:10:33,307 --> 00:10:34,307
Let me go.

151
00:10:40,514 --> 00:10:42,466
Let me go.

152
00:10:42,466 --> 00:10:44,401
I don't have any money. I really don't.

153
00:10:44,401 --> 00:10:46,465
Don't be like that.

154
00:10:47,055 --> 00:10:49,967
You are just like your mom.

155
00:10:49,967 --> 00:10:52,632
I know you have sneaked money
from the restaurant.

156
00:10:52,632 --> 00:10:53,793
So give it to me when I am nice.

157
00:10:55,567 --> 00:10:57,582
Are you saying I am a thief?

158
00:10:57,582 --> 00:10:59,431
You're the one who ran away taking money.

159
00:10:59,431 --> 00:11:00,770
What? What did you just say?

160
00:11:00,770 --> 00:11:01,863
Stop it.

161
00:11:02,492 --> 00:11:04,404
Here, I have money.

162
00:11:04,404 --> 00:11:07,539
Take this. You can take this.

163
00:11:07,539 --> 00:11:08,567
Here you are.

164
00:11:08,567 --> 00:11:10,877
Choi Sin Ae. Is she your friend?

165
00:11:12,546 --> 00:11:15,065
What are you doing?
Who do you think you are?

166
00:11:15,065 --> 00:11:16,067
You!

167
00:11:16,067 --> 00:11:17,070
No!

168
00:11:22,850 --> 00:11:23,909
Thanks.

169
00:11:25,522 --> 00:11:28,504
Don't ever come back!

170
00:11:32,602 --> 00:11:33,629
Is he your brother?

171
00:11:35,594 --> 00:11:37,747
Yes, he is my brother.

172
00:11:37,747 --> 00:11:39,090
He is a gangster.

173
00:11:39,090 --> 00:11:40,983
Are you happy now?

174
00:11:41,555 --> 00:11:43,698
No, I am not...

175
00:11:43,698 --> 00:11:47,716
I really wish you would disappear.

176
00:12:03,819 --> 00:12:04,819
Sin Ae.

177
00:12:40,103 --> 00:12:43,849
Sin Ae, why were you crying?

178
00:12:50,477 --> 00:12:52,805
The school is pretty far from your house,

179
00:12:54,939 --> 00:12:56,120
can't you ride a bike?

180
00:12:56,836 --> 00:12:58,606
No, I cannot.

181
00:13:01,219 --> 00:13:03,179
Then, can I...

182
00:13:03,179 --> 00:13:04,684
I cannot ride one,
because I don't have one.

183
00:13:05,456 --> 00:13:07,708
We cannot afford a bike.

184
00:13:09,161 --> 00:13:12,618
A bike is for kids like Eun Seo.

185
00:13:18,185 --> 00:13:21,265
When did your dad pass away?

186
00:13:22,952 --> 00:13:24,315
Before I was born.

187
00:13:27,096 --> 00:13:31,576
Have you ever thought...

188
00:13:31,576 --> 00:13:32,995
"I wish I had a father?"

189
00:13:39,495 --> 00:13:40,523
I am sorry.

190
00:13:43,055 --> 00:13:44,914
You are a good girl.

191
00:13:46,742 --> 00:13:50,545
You help your mom, but you are still
at the top of the whole school.

192
00:13:51,833 --> 00:13:53,700
She leaves me alone when I study.

193
00:13:55,543 --> 00:13:57,683
I can't wait to grow up
to run away from home.

194
00:14:04,433 --> 00:14:05,507
I am sorry.

195
00:15:30,783 --> 00:15:32,618
How cute you are.

196
00:15:32,618 --> 00:15:34,033
Is he a philanthropist?

197
00:15:34,033 --> 00:15:36,442
Like father, like daughter.

198
00:15:36,442 --> 00:15:39,628
Where can I find a father like him?

199
00:15:41,641 --> 00:15:44,681
Why did you hit me?

200
00:15:44,681 --> 00:15:46,665
Where did you get this?

201
00:15:46,665 --> 00:15:47,867
Who gave it to you?

202
00:15:49,073 --> 00:15:50,485
Tell me the truth.

203
00:15:52,513 --> 00:15:54,610
I did not do anything wrong.

204
00:15:54,610 --> 00:15:56,357
Eun Seo's father, whom we met before.

205
00:15:56,357 --> 00:15:58,200
Why did you meet him?

206
00:15:59,699 --> 00:16:02,157
We ran into each other near the school.

207
00:16:02,157 --> 00:16:04,021
Are you a beggar?

208
00:16:04,021 --> 00:16:05,028
- Are you a beggar?
- Mom.

209
00:16:05,028 --> 00:16:06,507
Why did you get this from him?

210
00:16:06,507 --> 00:16:08,227
Get out of here!

211
00:16:08,227 --> 00:16:11,372
I am working like a dog
to feed you and let you study.

212
00:16:11,372 --> 00:16:12,771
And now you are acting like...

213
00:16:12,771 --> 00:16:14,385
Get out of here!

214
00:16:14,385 --> 00:16:15,537
What is wrong with you?

215
00:16:15,537 --> 00:16:18,512
Does it make you that upset
that I got a teddy bear?

216
00:16:18,512 --> 00:16:20,218
What have you ever done for me?

217
00:16:20,218 --> 00:16:22,201
Have you ever bought me
something like this?

218
00:16:22,201 --> 00:16:25,617
All you do every day is beat me, scold me,
and force me to work at your restaurant.

219
00:16:25,617 --> 00:16:26,617
What?

220
00:16:27,445 --> 00:16:28,892
You're right.

221
00:16:28,892 --> 00:16:32,276
Despite having so much money,
I never bought you a doll.

222
00:16:32,276 --> 00:16:35,196
And I made you work in a restaurant,
so I can have a good life for myself.

223
00:16:35,196 --> 00:16:36,659
Yes, I did just that!

224
00:16:36,659 --> 00:16:38,787
I am sick of this.

225
00:16:38,787 --> 00:16:40,675
No one lives like me.

226
00:16:40,675 --> 00:16:42,450
Even if they are much worse
at school work,

227
00:16:42,450 --> 00:16:44,635
they wear better clothes than me.

228
00:16:44,635 --> 00:16:46,410
And they get this thing
as much as they want.

229
00:16:46,410 --> 00:16:47,914
But, what about me?

230
00:16:47,914 --> 00:16:51,604
Eun Seo, who is worse than I am at school,
is the president because of her parents.

231
00:16:51,604 --> 00:16:53,325
What am I?

232
00:16:54,028 --> 00:16:58,204
Go live with them
if you're so envious of that.

233
00:16:58,204 --> 00:16:59,283
Go live with them.

234
00:16:59,283 --> 00:17:01,939
Okay, I will go there.
I will get out of here.

235
00:17:01,939 --> 00:17:02,946
Get out of my face.

236
00:17:02,946 --> 00:17:04,628
Go live there because that is your house.

237
00:17:05,706 --> 00:17:07,836
Go with your wealthy biological parents!

238
00:17:12,705 --> 00:17:13,748
Biological parents?

239
00:17:23,296 --> 00:17:24,476
Did you say, "biological parents?"

240
00:17:27,873 --> 00:17:29,171
What do you mean?

241
00:17:29,923 --> 00:17:31,324
What do you mean by that?

242
00:17:32,728 --> 00:17:34,277
Your dreams have come true.

243
00:17:35,353 --> 00:17:37,612
You are about to leave this house,
you ingrate.

244
00:17:39,089 --> 00:17:41,513
Go to your wealthy parents.

245
00:17:41,513 --> 00:17:45,252
Go to your wealthy biological parents
who can afford to buy this thing.

246
00:18:11,312 --> 00:18:12,939
How come you are here?

247
00:18:13,390 --> 00:18:15,471
When I was passing by on a bus...

248
00:18:15,471 --> 00:18:17,576
I saw your car, so I got off.

249
00:18:22,887 --> 00:18:25,594
Where were you coming from?

250
00:18:26,328 --> 00:18:27,338
What about you?

251
00:18:28,207 --> 00:18:31,929
I just...

252
00:18:37,174 --> 00:18:43,185
Why don't we go somewhere with
Eun Seo and Jun Seo to get some fresh air?

253
00:18:44,140 --> 00:18:45,140
Today?

254
00:18:46,418 --> 00:18:48,344
Yes, let's go, please.

255
00:18:52,484 --> 00:18:53,830
Yes.

256
00:18:54,859 --> 00:18:55,911
Good job.

257
00:18:56,756 --> 00:18:58,767
Roll it now.

258
00:18:59,652 --> 00:19:01,237
Pull it a little.

259
00:19:01,237 --> 00:19:02,928
Roll it again.

260
00:19:02,928 --> 00:19:04,743
A little more.

261
00:19:04,743 --> 00:19:07,970
Good. Pull it up...

262
00:19:08,895 --> 00:19:10,259
Great job.

263
00:19:10,816 --> 00:19:12,876
Good. Roll it.

264
00:19:13,609 --> 00:19:16,721
That's right. Make it tight.

265
00:19:16,721 --> 00:19:18,713
A little more.

266
00:19:18,713 --> 00:19:20,172
Great.

267
00:19:23,321 --> 00:19:26,080
Honey, aren't you cold?
Do you want me to bring your shawl?

268
00:19:26,718 --> 00:19:30,793
Honey, you look good with Eun Seo.

269
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:40,096
The dean called this afternoon.

270
00:19:41,293 --> 00:19:43,326
You were not there...

271
00:19:43,326 --> 00:19:48,344
so I told him we would go
to be exchange professors as planned.

272
00:19:48,344 --> 00:19:51,769
Honey, today, I am actually...

273
00:19:51,769 --> 00:19:55,790
Honey, I am happy now.

274
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:58,320
We are happy now.

275
00:19:58,320 --> 00:20:00,975
Please let it go. Please do it for me.

276
00:20:01,755 --> 00:20:04,089
I will be a better wife.

277
00:20:04,089 --> 00:20:06,860
I will be a better mom.

278
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:09,763
I can forget everything and move on
if we are like this.

279
00:20:09,763 --> 00:20:11,634
So please do it for me.

280
00:20:11,634 --> 00:20:13,614
Please.

281
00:20:29,610 --> 00:20:30,915
Let me see.

282
00:20:35,153 --> 00:20:37,837
It is working fine.

283
00:20:37,837 --> 00:20:39,695
Don't you think you aren't good at it?

284
00:20:43,355 --> 00:20:45,795
No, Eun Seo, you are prettier.

285
00:20:45,795 --> 00:20:48,106
Whom do you look after to be so pretty?

286
00:20:48,106 --> 00:20:50,570
I am pretty because I look like my mom.
Do you want to see her?

287
00:20:50,570 --> 00:20:52,645
Okay.

288
00:20:54,930 --> 00:20:57,008
Your mom is so beautiful.

289
00:20:57,008 --> 00:20:58,689
Eun Seo, are you feeling good?

290
00:20:58,689 --> 00:21:02,628
Yes, Eun Seo is in a good mood today.

291
00:21:03,217 --> 00:21:07,969
It makes me the happiest dad.

292
00:21:07,969 --> 00:21:10,511
It gives me the happiest feeling, too.

293
00:21:11,665 --> 00:21:14,316
Yoon Jun Seo, are you feeling good?

294
00:21:16,065 --> 00:21:19,159
I am so happy as well.

295
00:21:19,159 --> 00:21:20,377
That was funny.

296
00:22:11,838 --> 00:22:13,778
Sin Ae, what's wrong?

297
00:22:17,311 --> 00:22:20,643
I was kicked out of my house.

298
00:22:22,223 --> 00:22:24,176
I have nowhere to go.

299
00:22:24,176 --> 00:22:25,210
Choi Sin Ae.

300
00:22:28,336 --> 00:22:30,938
But why did you come here...

301
00:22:34,239 --> 00:22:35,239
Is that...

302
00:22:36,751 --> 00:22:40,995
My mom beat me
because of this teddy bear you bought me.

303
00:22:44,360 --> 00:22:48,177
Sin Ae, I can come with you...

304
00:22:48,177 --> 00:22:50,395
I heard everything.

305
00:22:50,395 --> 00:22:52,214
My mom told me all about it.

306
00:22:54,586 --> 00:22:58,472
Mom, what is this about?

307
00:23:04,578 --> 00:23:07,703
Is that true?

308
00:23:11,803 --> 00:23:14,239
Is it true I am your daughter?

309
00:23:24,506 --> 00:23:25,565
Sin Ae.

310
00:23:27,084 --> 00:23:29,240
- You and I were switched.
- Sin Ae.

311
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:31,954
I am their daughter, not you.

312
00:23:52,624 --> 00:23:54,425
Eun Seo.

313
00:24:03,256 --> 00:24:04,256
Eun Seo.

314
00:25:01,223 --> 00:25:02,345
Eun Seo.

315
00:25:04,208 --> 00:25:05,306
Yoon Eun Seo.

316
00:25:06,918 --> 00:25:07,985
Eun Seo.

317
00:25:12,335 --> 00:25:13,449
Yoon Eun Seo.

318
00:25:19,383 --> 00:25:20,481
Eun Seo.

319
00:25:23,647 --> 00:25:24,817
Yoon Eun Seo.

320
00:25:26,895 --> 00:25:27,921
Eun Seo.

321
00:25:55,983 --> 00:25:57,514
How did you come this far?

322
00:25:58,503 --> 00:26:00,563
It is late at night, what if you get lost?

323
00:26:08,985 --> 00:26:14,273
Am I really not their daughter?

324
00:26:19,008 --> 00:26:23,858
Am I not your sister?

325
00:26:25,047 --> 00:26:28,101
Yes, you are my sister.

326
00:26:28,912 --> 00:26:30,088
You are my sister.

327
00:26:30,088 --> 00:26:31,436
She said I am not.

328
00:26:31,993 --> 00:26:33,092
Eun Seo.

329
00:26:34,048 --> 00:26:36,195
Right, it did not feel right.

330
00:26:37,776 --> 00:26:41,355
I am not good at paintings like you are.

331
00:26:42,583 --> 00:26:44,459
Everyone says we don't look alike.

332
00:26:45,873 --> 00:26:47,300
I am not good at school.

333
00:26:49,417 --> 00:26:55,579
Mom, Dad, and you all are smart.

334
00:26:55,579 --> 00:26:56,612
But I am not.

335
00:26:59,209 --> 00:27:02,232
Yoon Eun Seo, that's enough.

336
00:27:02,232 --> 00:27:04,652
You are my sister.

337
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:06,596
So, let's go home.

338
00:27:10,622 --> 00:27:12,977
Yoon Eun Seo, let's go back.

339
00:27:14,632 --> 00:27:15,978
Are you really doing this?

340
00:27:17,417 --> 00:27:20,569
All right, then you are not my sister.

341
00:27:20,569 --> 00:27:22,634
My sister is a good girl.

342
00:27:23,223 --> 00:27:26,770
My sister is not a girl
who makes her brother upset.

343
00:27:28,342 --> 00:27:31,873
Do you have any idea how scared I was
when you were gone?

344
00:27:32,831 --> 00:27:35,944
Even when we play Hide-and-Seek,

345
00:27:35,944 --> 00:27:37,672
my sister puts a mark
on a location she hides,

346
00:27:37,672 --> 00:27:40,495
in case I take too much time to find her.

347
00:27:40,495 --> 00:27:41,904
My sister is that kind of a girl.

348
00:27:42,512 --> 00:27:45,155
That's her. That is my sister.

349
00:27:46,392 --> 00:27:49,603
Why are you crying?

350
00:28:03,558 --> 00:28:04,558
Let's go.

351
00:28:11,631 --> 00:28:12,929
I'll give you a piggyback ride.

352
00:29:45,458 --> 00:29:46,677
How are Jun Seo and Eun Seo?

353
00:29:47,515 --> 00:29:48,884
How is Sin Ae?

354
00:29:48,884 --> 00:29:50,659
Bring her back tomorrow morning.

355
00:29:51,856 --> 00:29:53,912
- Honey.
- Bring her back.

356
00:29:56,316 --> 00:29:58,835
How can we do that to her?

357
00:29:58,835 --> 00:30:00,379
Why are you so cruel?

358
00:30:00,379 --> 00:30:02,766
Yes, I am cruel.

359
00:30:07,699 --> 00:30:11,069
If Eun Seo is your daughter,
Sin Ae is your daughter, too.

360
00:30:11,069 --> 00:30:13,380
Sin Ae is our actual daughter.

361
00:30:14,713 --> 00:30:18,965
Have you imagined
how her life has been for 14 years?

362
00:30:23,505 --> 00:30:26,805
If she had had a good life...

363
00:30:28,778 --> 00:30:30,347
if she had had a good life
like that of Eun Seo,

364
00:30:30,347 --> 00:30:31,917
I wouldn't be doing this.

365
00:30:33,394 --> 00:30:37,345
Thinking of her lived
in that soup restaurant until now...

366
00:30:37,345 --> 00:30:39,761
And thinking of her
growing up in that house...

367
00:30:39,761 --> 00:30:40,765
That's enough.

368
00:30:43,417 --> 00:30:45,827
I can't. I can't send her back.

369
00:30:45,827 --> 00:30:47,305
I won't do it.

370
00:30:47,305 --> 00:30:48,753
Can you do that?

371
00:30:48,753 --> 00:30:51,322
Don't you care about Sin Ae,
not even a little?

372
00:30:51,322 --> 00:30:52,716
Caring for her...

373
00:30:54,431 --> 00:30:56,015
I will not think about her.

374
00:30:56,015 --> 00:30:57,015
Honey.

375
00:30:58,382 --> 00:31:01,623
If I care for her, what about Eun Seo?

376
00:31:01,623 --> 00:31:04,358
Have you thought about
how Eun Seo would feel?

377
00:31:04,358 --> 00:31:06,175
Are you going to give her up?

378
00:31:06,175 --> 00:31:07,747
Are you going to kick her out?

379
00:31:08,358 --> 00:31:12,583
If I don't protect Eun Seo now, who would?

380
00:31:12,583 --> 00:31:15,231
If I don't keep myself together,
we'll lose Eun Seo.

381
00:31:15,231 --> 00:31:17,162
We will lose her forever.

382
00:31:46,204 --> 00:31:48,392
Don't touch Eun Seo's clothes.

383
00:31:48,392 --> 00:31:49,995
I got fresh underwear for you
to change into.

384
00:32:05,952 --> 00:32:07,085
Take a seat, Eun Seo.

385
00:32:09,858 --> 00:32:11,363
Good morning.

386
00:33:59,203 --> 00:34:01,736
"The whole school will know soon."

387
00:34:01,736 --> 00:34:03,038
Isn't that what you thought?

388
00:34:04,289 --> 00:34:05,289
Eun Seo.

389
00:34:06,434 --> 00:34:10,942
"How would she bear even a day?
I'm so worried."

390
00:34:10,942 --> 00:34:12,218
Isn't that what you thought?

391
00:34:13,856 --> 00:34:18,240
"She should stop going to school
for a while."

392
00:34:18,240 --> 00:34:19,465
Isn't that what you thought?

393
00:34:21,455 --> 00:34:24,455
"I will be strong despite all this."

394
00:34:24,455 --> 00:34:25,602
Isn't that what you thought?

395
00:34:27,368 --> 00:34:30,761
You think, "I believe in Eun Seo." Right?

396
00:34:32,023 --> 00:34:35,449
Yes, I believe in you.

397
00:34:35,449 --> 00:34:36,671
So do I.

398
00:34:36,671 --> 00:34:40,073
I won't be weak. Don't worry.

399
00:35:18,895 --> 00:35:21,514
So, do you live in her house?

400
00:35:22,743 --> 00:35:25,377
Of course,
It was my home from the beginning.

401
00:35:25,886 --> 00:35:28,664
Then, she should go to your house.

402
00:35:32,165 --> 00:35:33,567
She had better do it.

403
00:35:33,567 --> 00:35:34,667
Eun Seo.

404
00:35:34,667 --> 00:35:36,281
What a surprise.

405
00:35:36,962 --> 00:35:39,350
Eun Seo, what are you supposed to do now?

406
00:35:39,350 --> 00:35:41,399
What are you supposed to do, Eun Seo?

407
00:35:41,859 --> 00:35:43,768
Stop crying, Kang Hee.

408
00:35:47,404 --> 00:35:49,207
Stop crying. It is fine.

409
00:36:01,468 --> 00:36:02,655
Welcome...

410
00:36:15,436 --> 00:36:16,958
A bowl of hot soup with rice, please.

411
00:36:58,393 --> 00:37:00,099
So she did go to your house.

412
00:37:01,537 --> 00:37:03,019
What do we do now?

413
00:37:06,072 --> 00:37:07,885
What are we supposed to do?

414
00:37:09,631 --> 00:37:14,355
How do others deal with
this kind of matter?

415
00:37:15,952 --> 00:37:19,268
Do they switch their children back?

416
00:37:21,600 --> 00:37:23,051
Should we...

417
00:37:26,175 --> 00:37:27,489
switch our children back as well?

418
00:37:29,743 --> 00:37:31,224
Sin Ae.

419
00:37:32,405 --> 00:37:33,753
Please take her back.

420
00:37:36,709 --> 00:37:43,519
I came here to ask you that.

421
00:37:45,836 --> 00:37:51,966
Since Eun Seo was little,
she has been sickly and fragile.

422
00:37:51,966 --> 00:37:54,514
So I have been taking care of her
very delicately.

423
00:37:54,514 --> 00:37:57,470
Eun Seo is my daughter.
Please let me raise her.

424
00:37:59,885 --> 00:38:05,532
Don't you feel sorry for Sin Ae that
could not enjoy nice meals and clothes...

425
00:38:05,532 --> 00:38:07,645
growing up in this house?

426
00:38:11,730 --> 00:38:13,183
Take good care of her.

427
00:38:15,723 --> 00:38:21,093
I cannot take care of Sin Ae well.

428
00:38:23,179 --> 00:38:27,324
My husband's gambling and illness...

429
00:38:27,324 --> 00:38:29,292
took up all the money in the house.

430
00:38:31,443 --> 00:38:35,302
I have done all kinds of jobs
to make ends meet.

431
00:38:37,595 --> 00:38:39,481
Surviving was my top priority,

432
00:38:40,532 --> 00:38:44,405
so I could not take care of her well.

433
00:38:46,418 --> 00:38:48,006
That is probably why Sin Ae...

434
00:38:50,483 --> 00:38:53,069
has not been a nice and kind girl.

435
00:38:54,243 --> 00:38:56,022
Take good care of her.

436
00:38:58,097 --> 00:39:03,614
Although
I could not take care of her well,

437
00:39:07,067 --> 00:39:08,909
Sin Ae is my only daughter.

438
00:39:12,555 --> 00:39:14,381
I cannot send her away.

439
00:39:15,362 --> 00:39:19,046
I wanted to tell you to let us live
as we did.

440
00:39:27,271 --> 00:39:28,681
What has Sin Ae been like?

441
00:39:31,135 --> 00:39:33,136
Has she been eating well?

442
00:39:36,583 --> 00:39:37,807
She has.

443
00:39:40,342 --> 00:39:45,393
When did she say her first words?

444
00:39:50,704 --> 00:39:52,977
When did she start to walk?

445
00:39:58,480 --> 00:39:59,840
I am sorry.

446
00:40:01,294 --> 00:40:05,794
Sin Ae, was she pretty
even when she was little?

447
00:40:08,839 --> 00:40:10,760
Did she have a lot of friends?

448
00:40:15,655 --> 00:40:16,890
Sin Ae.

449
00:40:22,661 --> 00:40:23,994
Sin Ae.

450
00:40:27,687 --> 00:40:29,147
My Sin Ae

451
00:40:35,544 --> 00:40:37,164
Please take good care of her.

452
00:40:39,320 --> 00:40:40,961
Take good care of her.

453
00:40:45,280 --> 00:40:46,882
Please take good care of her.

454
00:41:14,349 --> 00:41:19,870
My pale pink skirt is

455
00:41:19,870 --> 00:41:22,450
Fluttering

456
00:41:24,216 --> 00:41:29,683
In the spring wind

457
00:41:32,567 --> 00:41:38,875
Biting my dress string again today

458
00:41:41,399 --> 00:41:48,058
On the village shrine road
visited by spring maidens

459
00:41:49,648 --> 00:41:51,715
When the flowers bloom

460
00:41:55,321 --> 00:41:56,996
We laugh together

461
00:42:00,490 --> 00:42:02,751
When the flowers fall

462
00:42:04,786 --> 00:42:06,707
We cry together

463
00:42:09,169 --> 00:42:15,251
With that sweet vow

464
00:42:18,625 --> 00:42:25,303
Spring days are gone

465
00:42:35,413 --> 00:42:36,413
Yoon Eun Seo.

466
00:42:43,334 --> 00:42:45,120
Choi Sin Ae, what is it?

467
00:42:50,980 --> 00:42:52,239
Where are you going?

468
00:42:55,708 --> 00:42:56,708
I'm going home.

469
00:42:59,677 --> 00:43:02,239
That is not the way to your home.

470
00:43:04,893 --> 00:43:06,861
What are you talking about?

471
00:43:06,861 --> 00:43:08,240
Yoon Eun Seo.

472
00:43:09,732 --> 00:43:12,172
No, Choi Eun Seo.

473
00:43:12,172 --> 00:43:13,247
Are you scared?

474
00:43:13,796 --> 00:43:17,933
Are you scared that the soup lady
became your mom all of a sudden?

475
00:43:17,933 --> 00:43:19,991
Are you scared
you will have a gangster brother?

476
00:43:21,341 --> 00:43:24,692
You are bad. You are so mean.

477
00:43:24,692 --> 00:43:26,556
She is your mother.

478
00:43:26,556 --> 00:43:30,452
How could you say that
about the lady who raised you?

479
00:43:30,452 --> 00:43:31,838
You are so mean.

480
00:43:35,436 --> 00:43:37,987
- Choi Sin Ae.
- Let's go together.

481
00:43:37,987 --> 00:43:39,070
What do you know?

482
00:43:39,070 --> 00:43:41,316
What do you know about my family
to tell me I'm mean?

483
00:43:41,316 --> 00:43:44,059
Let's go. See it yourself.

484
00:43:44,059 --> 00:43:45,427
Choi Sin Ae. What are you doing?

485
00:43:45,427 --> 00:43:46,620
You stay out of it.

486
00:43:46,620 --> 00:43:47,622
Come with me.

487
00:43:48,411 --> 00:43:49,519
Eun Seo.

488
00:43:52,595 --> 00:43:54,182
What should I do?

489
00:43:58,309 --> 00:44:01,130
Jun Seo, there is a problem.

490
00:44:01,130 --> 00:44:04,184
Sin Ae took Eun Seo to her house.

491
00:44:05,061 --> 00:44:06,663
- What?
- Jun Seo, hurry.

492
00:44:07,801 --> 00:44:08,978
Soon Im.

493
00:44:08,978 --> 00:44:12,683
Hard times for you are over now.

494
00:44:12,683 --> 00:44:15,444
I heard Sin Ae's biological parents
are really wealthy.

495
00:44:16,090 --> 00:44:17,888
Where did you hear that?

496
00:44:17,888 --> 00:44:20,450
The whole school knows about it.

497
00:44:20,450 --> 00:44:22,930
My child told me.

498
00:44:22,930 --> 00:44:25,065
So, how much are you getting?

499
00:44:26,856 --> 00:44:30,680
Take as much as you want.

500
00:44:30,680 --> 00:44:35,440
You have raised their child for 14 years.

501
00:44:35,440 --> 00:44:37,727
They mustn't pretend that was nothing.

502
00:44:37,727 --> 00:44:39,188
Don't you think so?

503
00:44:41,745 --> 00:44:44,156
- Get out of here.
- What are you...?

504
00:44:44,156 --> 00:44:46,954
Are you going crazy
because you're so excited?

505
00:44:46,954 --> 00:44:47,965
Get out of my face.

506
00:44:48,473 --> 00:44:52,786
Do you always think about
how to make money by using your children?

507
00:44:52,786 --> 00:44:55,361
How dare you say that?

508
00:44:55,361 --> 00:44:57,083
What?

509
00:44:57,642 --> 00:44:58,661
You!

510
00:45:08,694 --> 00:45:09,744
Sin Ae.

511
00:45:10,381 --> 00:45:13,089
I am not Sin Ae. She is.

512
00:45:16,438 --> 00:45:18,713
Sin Ae, you idiot.

513
00:45:18,713 --> 00:45:21,229
She is your daughter.

514
00:45:23,986 --> 00:45:24,995
Jun Seo.

515
00:45:30,025 --> 00:45:31,316
Jun Seo.

516
00:45:38,309 --> 00:45:39,400
Sin...

517
00:45:54,375 --> 00:45:55,375
Let's go.

518
00:45:57,151 --> 00:45:59,318
What are you doing? Let's go home.

519
00:46:52,583 --> 00:46:53,657
Sin Ae.

520
00:47:06,577 --> 00:47:07,577
Sin Ae.

521
00:47:10,927 --> 00:47:12,523
Jun Seo hit me.

522
00:47:14,215 --> 00:47:15,626
Because of Eun Seo.

523
00:47:16,736 --> 00:47:18,195
Because of her.

524
00:47:20,576 --> 00:47:23,431
A girl should not wander around crying.

525
00:47:23,431 --> 00:47:25,283
Dinner is ready, so wash your hands.

526
00:47:25,283 --> 00:47:27,023
- Honey.
- I will go.

527
00:47:27,023 --> 00:47:28,582
I can leave.

528
00:47:28,582 --> 00:47:30,256
You live with Eun Seo.

529
00:47:33,654 --> 00:47:35,473
Why do you hate me so much?

530
00:47:36,639 --> 00:47:38,209
Why do you hate me?

531
00:47:39,190 --> 00:47:42,664
I am your daughter. You are my mom.

532
00:47:46,343 --> 00:47:49,734
I do errands for drinkers
at the restaurant every day.

533
00:47:49,734 --> 00:47:53,690
My mom always works,
and my brother hits me.

534
00:47:55,542 --> 00:47:57,502
Like Eun Seo, I want pretty clothes...

535
00:47:57,502 --> 00:48:00,520
and affection from my brother.

536
00:48:01,420 --> 00:48:03,942
Can't I have that?

537
00:48:03,942 --> 00:48:06,730
Don't I deserve to be loved
by Mom and Dad?

538
00:48:07,143 --> 00:48:09,062
Is it bad I am asking for those?

539
00:48:09,062 --> 00:48:11,417
Am I asking for too much
that you would hate me like this?

540
00:48:13,685 --> 00:48:18,048
You are my biological mother.

541
00:48:19,663 --> 00:48:21,937
My real mom.

542
00:48:26,950 --> 00:48:30,030
Mom.

543
00:48:30,030 --> 00:48:31,737
Mom.

544
00:48:34,902 --> 00:48:37,678
Sin Ae, I am sorry.

545
00:48:37,678 --> 00:48:40,046
I am so sorry.

546
00:48:40,046 --> 00:48:41,527
Sin Ae, don't cry.

547
00:48:41,527 --> 00:48:44,969
Don't cry, Sin Ae. I am sorry.

548
00:48:48,020 --> 00:48:49,863
I am so sorry.

549
00:48:51,521 --> 00:48:53,890
Don't cry, Sin Ae.

550
00:49:22,196 --> 00:49:24,074
- We are back.
- Jun Seo.

551
00:49:25,064 --> 00:49:28,291
Jun Seo, come with me.

552
00:49:28,864 --> 00:49:30,547
- Later.
- What?

553
00:49:31,216 --> 00:49:33,739
Dad, Jun Seo is...

554
00:49:33,739 --> 00:49:35,458
Why did you hit your sister?

555
00:49:35,458 --> 00:49:38,614
I did not hit Eun Seo.
I did not hit my sister.

556
00:49:41,354 --> 00:49:44,547
It would be very uncomfortable for Sin Ae
with this sudden change.

557
00:49:44,547 --> 00:49:46,714
You and Eun Seo should look after her.

558
00:49:46,714 --> 00:49:48,395
Sin Ae is also your sister.

559
00:49:48,395 --> 00:49:49,955
She is not my sister.

560
00:49:49,955 --> 00:49:51,858
My sister is here.

561
00:49:51,858 --> 00:49:54,906
After all this time...

562
00:49:54,906 --> 00:49:58,857
She might mean a lot to you and Mom,
but not to me.

563
00:49:58,857 --> 00:50:01,586
Tell her to go back to her house.

564
00:50:03,360 --> 00:50:04,443
Dad.

565
00:50:07,944 --> 00:50:09,051
Jun Seo.

566
00:50:09,936 --> 00:50:12,259
You go inside.

567
00:50:27,438 --> 00:50:29,471
What about Eun Seo?

568
00:50:29,471 --> 00:50:31,625
Do you even care about Eun Seo?

569
00:51:19,732 --> 00:51:21,031
Don't cry.

570
00:51:22,011 --> 00:51:23,869
Don't cry, Mom.

571
00:51:40,857 --> 00:51:43,651
Eun Seo, you have grown up.

572
00:51:44,592 --> 00:51:46,260
You can even get married.

573
00:51:51,426 --> 00:51:52,532
I agree.

574
00:51:54,315 --> 00:51:57,506
Eun Seo, my Eun Seo.

575
00:51:58,737 --> 00:52:01,243
The most beautiful daughter in the world.
My daughter, Eun Seo.

576
00:52:07,058 --> 00:52:11,116
Eun Seo is not pretty at all. She is ugly.

577
00:52:15,058 --> 00:52:19,980
Dad, Mom, and Jun Seo.

578
00:52:21,016 --> 00:52:23,267
Thank you all.

579
00:52:24,960 --> 00:52:28,613
Thank you for raising me
and taking care of me so far.

580
00:52:32,503 --> 00:52:34,124
I will take them with me.

581
00:52:35,344 --> 00:52:38,610
Then, I will be with you always.

582
00:52:44,840 --> 00:52:46,915
Dad, goodbye.

583
00:52:54,481 --> 00:52:56,772
Mom, the one I love the most. Bye.

584
00:53:00,743 --> 00:53:01,951
And...

585
00:53:06,060 --> 00:53:08,575
Jun Seo, goodbye.

586
00:53:53,458 --> 00:53:54,458
Eun Seo.

587
00:53:55,197 --> 00:53:56,371
Yoon Eun Seo.

588
00:53:59,810 --> 00:54:01,110
Eun Seo!

589
00:54:38,917 --> 00:54:40,862
Stop there.

590
00:54:40,862 --> 00:54:42,306
Leave the money.

591
00:54:43,887 --> 00:54:46,634
It is also Eun Seo's birthday today.

592
00:54:49,415 --> 00:54:50,785
Please give me Eun Seo back.

593
00:54:51,557 --> 00:54:53,378
Please let me meet Eun Seo.

594
00:54:54,078 --> 00:54:56,185
Mom.

595
00:54:57,109 --> 00:55:00,256
I can't go with you.

596
00:55:00,893 --> 00:55:01,997
Eun Seo.

597
00:55:01,997 --> 00:55:03,478
Eun Seo. No.

598
00:55:03,478 --> 00:55:05,058
Eun Seo.

599
00:55:05,662 --> 00:55:09,545
What do you want to be
if you were to be born again?

600
00:55:10,230 --> 00:55:11,510
What about you?

601
00:55:11,510 --> 00:55:14,990
I want to be a tree.

602
00:55:14,990 --> 00:55:18,718
Once it has taken root,
it can't move anywhere else.

603
00:55:18,718 --> 00:55:20,499
I want to be such a tree.

604
00:55:20,499 --> 00:55:24,565
Then I won't have to part with
anyone ever again.

605
00:55:25,636 --> 00:55:28,853
Jun Seo,
what is the name of your first love?

606
00:55:30,908 --> 00:55:31,965
Tree.
